# Licences

This repository contains material under two licences, and links to data covered
by neither.

## 1. Curated metadata — CC BY 4.0

Everything in `data/`, `docs/`, and `README.md` — the coding of the 109 papers,
the derived scores, the link verdicts and the written documentation — is
released under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence**.

You may share and adapt it, including commercially, provided you give
appropriate credit, link to the licence, and indicate whether changes were
made.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Suggested attribution:

> Tognolini, B. (2026). *Open Sustainable Finance Data* (Version 1.0.0)
> [Data set]. University of Zurich. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.

