## 3. The underlying datasets — not licensed here

This repository **links to the underlying data and does not redistribute it**. The datasets
described in the catalogue remain governed entirely by the terms their producers
set. For 92 of the 109 papers that includes at least one commercially licensed
input — CRSP, Compustat, Refinitiv, MSCI, Sustainalytics, Factiva and the like —
and neither licence above grants any rights in those.

Nor does anything here relicense the authors' own replication materials.
Whatever terms a Dataverse, Zenodo, Mendeley or OSF deposit carries continue to
apply; check the deposit before reuse.

## 4. The published papers

Bibliographic metadata is reproduced for scholarly reference. The papers
themselves are copyright of their authors and publishers, and are linked, not
reproduced.
